# DisjointClasses(C,D) desugars to C AND D subseteq bottom.
# NOTE this introduces owl:Nothing -- see hazards/owl-nothing-present.ttl.

@prefix :    <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:C a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class .
:C owl:disjointWith :D .
